stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Cockpit_Prep: Pre-Flight Checklists
    Cockpit_Prep --> Taxi_Out: Pushback & Taxi Clearance
    Taxi_Out --> Takeoff_Climb: Runway Line-up & TOGA Thrust
    Takeoff_Climb --> Enroute_Cruise: Reaching Initial Cruise FL
    Enroute_Cruise --> Step_Climb: Fuel Burn & Optimum FL
    Step_Climb --> Enroute_Cruise: Level-off
    Enroute_Cruise --> Descent_CDO: Top of Descent (TOD)
    Descent_CDO --> Approach_ILS: Initial Approach Fix (IAF)
    Approach_ILS --> Landing_Roll: Touchdown & Reversers
    Landing_Roll --> Taxi_In: Runway Vacated
    Taxi_In --> Chocks_On: Stand Arrival & Engines Off
    Chocks_On --> [*]
